Description: avcodec/h2645_sei_multiview: populate the appended mantissa fields
 .
 The edition already decodes reference displays through its common H.264/HEVC metadata path. Populate the ORDER 174 full-width fields there as well as in the original HEVC context path, preserving the existing AVMultiviewReal representation.
